msgid "Add Home Agent"
msgstr "添加家庭端"

msgid "Add Relay instance"
msgstr "添加中继实例"

msgid "Add directory entry"
msgstr "添加目录项"

msgid "Add every Home Agent that may host a logical service. Its SPKI key set is read automatically from the signed deployment trust. A Travel mapping selects one Home ID and one service; it never falls back to another Home."
msgstr "请添加所有可能承载逻辑业务的家庭端，其 SPKI 密钥集合会自动从已签名的部署信任中读取。每条旅行端映射会选择一个家庭端 ID 和一个服务，绝不会自动切换到其他家庭端。"

msgid "All enabled FlowSplice instances are valid."
msgstr "所有已启用的 FlowSplice 实例配置均有效。"

msgid "Create separate named instances for each entry path. Every instance binds its OpenWrt network device, discovers the matching IPv4 or IPv6 address, and reports both listener endpoints to Server automatically."
msgstr "请为每条入口路径创建独立的具名中继实例。每个实例会绑定对应的 OpenWrt 网络设备，自动发现匹配的 IPv4 或 IPv6 地址，并将两个监听端点报告给服务端。"

msgid "Data listen"
msgstr "数据监听地址"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Firewall exposure is intentionally managed separately. Installing or starting FlowSplice does not create WAN rules."
msgstr "防火墙暴露策略需单独管理。安装或启动 FlowSplice 不会自动创建 WAN 放行规则。"

